     <abstract pn="section-abstract">
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This RFC reports on the status of most Network Hosts from October 12
+to October 22.  (Monday, October 11 was Columbus Day.)  During these
+two weeks, the general status of these Hosts remained as it had been
+previously.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-2">The table on the following page summarizes the daily information on
+Host status for this period.</t>
